      "time": "~40s",
      "narrative": "The real value comes from grounding the agent in Caldova's knowledge.\n\nFor this one, I connect it to our contracts in Foundry IQ.\n\nNow, instead of guessing negotiated rates, it validates against the actual agreement.\n\nAnd because it's an extensible platform, I choose the model, the knowledge, and where the agent runs.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the configured enterprise connections and tool access in VS Code. Call out WorkIQ, FabricIQ, SharePoint, and Teams as knowledge sources the agent can use during reasoning.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
